          source video is 1080x1920. The tool gives you the largest version the platform publishes, not an
          upscaled copy with blurred edges and invented detail. For true full-frame quality, download the
          <a href="/tiktok-video-downloader-without-watermark">TikTok video without a watermark</a> and export
          a frame in an editor.
