          the download finishes. Tap it to open the image, or find it in the Downloads folder. Some Android
          launchers hide the Downloads icon by default; open the Files app and look under Downloads or Images.
          On a Chromebook, the file goes to the local Downloads folder and can be moved to Google Drive from
